      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_178b5714870a7d44a722",
      "document_start": 458,
      "document_end": 475,
      "text": "晶体压杆传感器主要用于冲击波测量。",
      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f833171a691a1d0f20d0",
      "document_start": 475,
      "document_end": 507,
      "text": "为了防止冲击波温度影响压电晶体，压电晶体通常焊在金属压杆的端面；",
      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_01d482731967fb76ff22",
      "document_start": 507,
      "document_end": 538,
      "text": "晶体外面焊一块未经极化的压电陶瓷（与晶体同一材料）作为隔热片。",
      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f94ad8baa2623ee4bb93",
      "document_start": 538,
      "document_end": 558,
      "text": "金属压杆借助于三条橡皮固定在外壳的内面。",
      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0727be40a40a39b432c0",
      "document_start": 558,
      "document_end": 632,
      "text": "冲击波压力经过隔热片作为应力波传到压电晶体，进而传入金属压杆，在到达压杆尾端面后又反射回来，这样应力波的往返反射每次经过压电晶体时都将产生压电信号。",
      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8f58925e3d3fb03fad75",
      "document_start": 632,
      "document_end": 657,
      "text": "适当地选择压杆长度可以延迟应力波返回晶体片的时间。",
      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0299c26b5016386d6d63",
      "document_start": 659,
      "document_end": 679,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7086e5eb2ca079a28287",
      "document_start": 680,
      "document_end": 704,
      "text": "# 1）电阻应变式力传感器（如图4-17所示）;",
