        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1278b42199caf47b8dc0",
          "document_start": 1018,
          "document_end": 1057,
          "text": "通过高速摄影可以记录其运动过程，然后利用图像处理方法，识别出被测点的振动参数。",
          "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400",
          "start": 1018,
          "end": 1057,
          "chunk_start": 1018,
          "chunk_end": 1057,
          "sentence_document_start": 1018,
          "sentence_document_end": 1057,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_423be5dc49c4932835db",
          "document_start": 1057,
          "document_end": 1087,
          "text": "一部摄像机获得的图像序列，可以识别出两个线位移和一个角位移。",
          "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400",
          "start": 1057,
          "end": 1087,
          "chunk_start": 1057,
          "chunk_end": 1087,
          "sentence_document_start": 1057,
