        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2acd4f446980af4bb6b4",
          "document_start": 1374,
          "document_end": 1408,
          "text": "压阻式加速度传感器利用半导体压敏电阻材料作为敏感元件测量振动加速度。",
          "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400",
          "start": 1374,
          "end": 1408,
          "chunk_start": 1374,
          "chunk_end": 1408,
          "sentence_document_start": 1374,
          "sentence_document_end": 1408,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_856aef2ca2bceddaa566",
          "document_start": 1408,
          "document_end": 1456,
          "text": "其低频响应好，具有测量零频响应的能力，灵敏度高、频响范围宽，其缺点是信噪比较低，受温度影响较大。",
          "section_id": "section_68bab1a46400",
          "start": 1408,
          "end": 1456,
          "chunk_start": 1408,
